    the Brainnetome terms (non-commercial, share-alike), and the WU-Minn HCP Open Access Data Use
    Terms. The F-TRACT atlas (web/data/ftract/) is CC BY 4.0, and its authors ask that it be used
    for research only. See DATA-LICENSES.md for credits and citations, and web/licenses/ for the
    full texts.
  - web/licenses/, which holds copies of those third-party terms.
  - web/vendor/, the bundled three.js and three-mesh-bvh libraries. They come with their own MIT
    licenses.


